                <head>No. 964<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On February 21 and February 25, the Foreign Minister of Egypt and Ambassador
                        Caffery signed and exchanged notes
                    concerning the Technical Cooperation Agreement of May 5, 1951, which had entered
                    into force on August 15, 1951. For the texts of these notes and the text of the
                    agreement, see TIAS No. 2479, printed in 3 UST
                    (pt. 2. 2960.</p>
            </div>
